    private static String sha(byte[] bytes)throws Exception {StringBuilder s=new StringBuilder();for(byte b:MessageDigest.getInstance("SHA-256").digest(bytes))s.append(String.format(Locale.ROOT,"%02x",b&255));return s.toString();}
    private short[] pcm()throws Exception {try(InputStream in=i.getContext().getAssets().open("classifier-fixtures/laughter-morning.pcm");ByteArrayOutputStream bytes=new ByteArrayOutputStream()){byte[] block=new byte[8192];for(int n;(n=in.read(block))!=-1;){assertTrue(bytes.size()+n<=437440);bytes.write(block,0,n);}byte[] raw=bytes.toByteArray();assertEquals(437440,raw.length);assertEquals(PCM_SHA,sha(raw));assertEquals(PREFIX_SHA,sha(Arrays.copyOf(raw,320000)));short[] result=new short[raw.length/2];ByteBuffer.wrap(raw).order(ByteOrder.LITTLE_ENDIAN).asShortBuffer().get(result);Arrays.fill(raw,(byte)0);return result;}}
    private File folder(){File f=new File(c.getExternalFilesDir(null),"verification");assertTrue(f.isDirectory()||f.mkdirs());return f;}
    private void proof(String name,JSONObject value)throws Exception {try(Writer w=new OutputStreamWriter(new FileOutputStream(new File(folder(),name)),java.nio.charset.StandardCharsets.UTF_8)){w.write(value.toString(2));w.write("\n");}}
    private View focused(){for(View v:WindowInspector.getGlobalWindowViews())if(v.isAttachedToWindow()&&v.hasWindowFocus()&&v.getContext().getPackageName().equals(c.getPackageName()))return v;return null;}
    private View find(View root,String label){if(root==null)return null;if(label.contentEquals(root.getContentDescription()==null?"":root.getContentDescription())||root instanceof TextView t&&label.contentEquals(t.getText()))return root;if(root instanceof ViewGroup g)for(int n=0;n<g.getChildCount();n++){View found=find(g.getChildAt(n),label);if(found!=null)return found;}return null;}
    private boolean shown(String label){boolean[] result={false};i.runOnMainSync(()->result[0]=find(focused(),label)!=null);return result[0];}
    private <T extends Activity>T live(Class<T> type){for(int n=activities.size()-1;n>=0;n--){Activity a=activities.get(n);if(type.isInstance(a)&&!a.isDestroyed()&&!a.isFinishing())return type.cast(a);}return null;}
    private View reveal(String label)throws Exception {step="visible "+label;await(()->shown(label));View[] owner={null};await(()->{boolean[] visible={false};i.runOnMainSync(()->{owner[0]=focused();View v=find(owner[0],label);if(v==null)return;v.requestRectangleOnScreen(new Rect(0,0,v.getWidth(),v.getHeight()),true);Rect r=new Rect();visible[0]=v.isEnabled()&&v.getGlobalVisibleRect(r)&&r.width()==v.getWidth()&&r.height()==v.getHeight();});return visible[0];});frame(owner[0]);return owner[0];}
    private void frame(View root)throws Exception {CountDownLatch done=new CountDownLatch(1);i.runOnMainSync(()->{assertSame(step,root,focused());assertTrue(root.isHardwareAccelerated());root.getViewTreeObserver().registerFrameCommitCallback(done::countDown);root.invalidate();});assertTrue(step,done.await(5,TimeUnit.SECONDS));}
    private void click(String label)throws Exception {View root=reveal(label);Rect[] target={null};i.runOnMainSync(()->{assertSame(root,focused());View v=find(root,label);while(v!=null&&!v.isClickable())v=v.getParent() instanceof View p?p:null;assertNotNull(label,v);assertTrue(label,v.isEnabled());Rect visible=new Rect();assertTrue(v.getGlobalVisibleRect(visible));assertEquals(v.getWidth(),visible.width());assertEquals(v.getHeight(),visible.height());assertTrue(label,v.getHeight()>=Design.dp(c,48));int[] at=new int[2];v.getLocationOnScreen(at);target[0]=new Rect(at[0],at[1],at[0]+v.getWidth(),at[1]+v.getHeight());});assertTrue(device.click(target[0].centerX(),target[0].centerY()));}
    private void capture(String name,String visible)throws Exception {assertTrue(captures<9);View root=reveal(visible);frame(root);assertTrue(device.takeScreenshot(new File(folder(),name+".png")));captures++;quiet();}
    private <T extends Activity>T launch(Class<T> type,Intent intent,String label)throws Exception {Instrumentation.ActivityMonitor monitor=i.addMonitor(type.getName(),null,false);try{c.startActivity(intent.putExtra("visualReview",true).putExtra("verificationLabel","CI licensed additional-sound fixture · no capture/output").addFlags(Intent.FLAG_ACTIVITY_NEW_TASK));T a=type.cast(monitor.waitForActivityWithTimeout(8000));assertNotNull(a);await(()->shown(label));return a;}finally{i.removeMonitor(monitor);}}
